None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that sent forbidden recurrenceOverrides patches, photos that are
not images, members on non-group cards, Blob/lookup types without their
capability in "using", or relied on utcStart in the calendar's zone, get
errors or different values.  Editing an existing
card whose photo is not an image fails until the photo is replaced.


